  "tha-ap465:0.1": "",
  "tha-ap465:0.2": "",
  "tha-ap465:0.3": "11. 3. Citakanibbāpakattheraapadānaṃ ",
  "tha-ap465:1.1": "‘‘Dayhamāne sarīramhi, ",
  "tha-ap465:1.2": "vessabhussa mahesino; ",
  "tha-ap465:1.3": "Gandhodakaṃ gahetvāna, ",
  "tha-ap465:1.4": "citaṃ nibbāpayiṃ ahaṃ. ",
  "tha-ap465:2.1": "12. ‘‘Ekatiṃse ito kappe, ",
  "tha-ap465:2.2": "citaṃ nibbāpayiṃ ahaṃ; ",
  "tha-ap465:2.3": "Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, ",
  "tha-ap465:2.4": "gandhodakassidaṃ phalaṃ. ",
  "tha-ap465:3.1": "13. ‘‘Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ…pe… ",
  "tha-ap465:3.2": "",
  "tha-ap465:3.3": "viharāmi anāsavo. ",
  "tha-ap465:4.1": "14. ‘‘Svāgataṃ vata me āsi…pe… ",
  "tha-ap465:4.2": "",
  "tha-ap465:4.3": "kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ. ",
  "tha-ap465:5.1": "15. ‘‘Paṭisambhidā catasso…pe… ",
  "tha-ap465:5.2": "",
  "tha-ap465:5.3": "kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ’’. ",
  "tha-ap465:6.1": "Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā citakanibbāpako thero imā Gāthāyo abhāsitthāti. ",
  "tha-ap465:7.1": "Citakanibbāpakattherassāpadānaṃ tatiyaṃ. "
}
